MAKE</button></div>`).join('')}else{const saves=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('wildbound-heroes')||'[]');c.innerHTML=`<p style="color:#b6c4b8;font-size:12px">${biome.name} · Seed <b style="color:#e4c981">${seed}</b><br>Free roam · ${kills} creatures befriended or defeated · ${Math.floor(day/60)} minutes beneath the open sky.</p><div class="item"><span>Rumor: A little trouble<small>Help the hamlet send 3 meadow imps packing · ${Math.min(questCount,3)}/3</small></span><b>${questCount>=3?'DONE':'OPEN'}</b></div><div class="item"><span>Companion<small>${companion?'Pip · bond '+companionBond+' · curious fox':'No companion yet · try offering a sunberry'}</small></span><b>${companion?'♥':'—'}</b></div><button class="primary" id="saveHero" style="margin-top:8px">SAVE THIS HERO</button><button class="primary" id="newHero" style="margin-top:8px;background:#344a43;color:#e8e7d8">CREATE ANOTHER HERO</button>`}c.querySelectorAll('[data-craft]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{const r=recipes[+b.dataset.craft],ok=Object.entries(r.cost).every(([k,v])=>(inventory[k]||0)>=v);if(!ok){say('Not enough ingredients yet.');return}for(const [k,v]of Object.entries(r.cost))inventory[k]-=v;r.action();renderModal()});c.querySelectorAll('[data-learn]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{let i=+b.dataset.learn;if(i===0){say('Already part of your path.');return}if(!skillPoints){say('Earn a skill point by leveling up.');return}skillPoints--;say('Skill learned! Your path grows stronger.');updateHud();renderModal()});const save=$('#saveHero');if(save)save.onclick=()=>{let a=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('wildbound-heroes')||'[]');if(!a.some(x=>x.name===hero.name))a.push({name:hero.name,class:hero.class,race:hero.race,level});localStorage.setItem('wildbound-heroes',JSON.stringify(a));say(`${hero.name} saved to this device.`)};const another=$('#newHero');if(another)another.onclick=()=>{active=false;$('#modal').classList.remove('open');$('#hud').style.display='none';$('#startPanel').classList.remove('hidden')};}
